{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17153","headline":"石季伦金谷园 · 李君房","name":"石季伦金谷园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梓泽风流地，凄凉迹尚存。\n残芳迷妓女，衰草忆王孙。\n舞态随人谢，歌声寄鸟言。\n池平森灌木，月落吊空园。\n流水悲难驻，浮云影自翻。\n宾阶余藓石，车马讵喧喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李君房","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}